sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cl as Client
    participant DNS as DNS
    participant LB as L7 load balancer
    participant Svc as Service
    participant Ca as Cache
    participant DB as Database
    Cl->>DNS: resolve the hostname
    DNS-->>Cl: address
    Cl->>LB: TCP, then TLS handshake
    LB->>LB: pick a backend — health and load
    LB->>Svc: forward the request
    Svc->>Ca: read-through lookup
    alt cache hit
        Ca-->>Svc: value
    else miss
        Svc->>DB: query
        DB-->>Svc: row
        Svc->>Ca: populate with a TTL
    end
    Svc-->>Cl: response
    Note over Cl,Svc: timeouts, bounded retries with jitter, and a breaker sit on every hop
